"description":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"},{"id":4004232977,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBlCVUc7uq78R","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/status/awaiting-triage","name":"status/awaiting-triage","color":"E33F0D","default":false,"description":"Issue awaiting triage"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"gauravk-in","id":564644,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDY0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/564644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in","html_url":"https://github.com/gauravk-in","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"gauravk-in","id":564644,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDY0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/564644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in","html_url":"https://github.com/gauravk-in","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-02-03T22:54:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T10:42:59Z","closed_at":"2025-02-11T10:42:59Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-15157](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-15157)\r\n### Description\n\nIn a large table with rows more than the maximum value of int viz. 2147483647, the estimated number of seeks and nexts may overflow. This may lead to undefined behavior. \n\nIn the following example, the value of num_nexts overflows. When run on a debug build, the \"Estimated Nexts\" gets set to the maximum value of int. However, on a release build it gets set to -2147483648, which is the smallest negative value possible in int. This led to a negative cost in the release build. \n\nThis can be fixed by using double for estimated seeks and nexts to match the type of reltuples.\n\n```\ncreate table test (k1 int);\n\n-- Update pg_class to simulate a large table\nset yb_non_ddl_txn_for_sys_tables_allowed = ON;\nupdate pg_class set reltuples=4000000000 where relname='test';\nupdate pg_yb_catalog_version set current_version=current_version+1 where db_oid=1;\nset yb_non_ddl_txn_for_sys_tables_allowed = OFF;\n\n-- Enable CBO\nset yb_enable_base_scans_cost_model = ON;\n\nexplain (debug) select * from test where k1 > 0;\n                               QUERY PLAN                               \n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n Seq Scan on test  (cost=180.00..1872031195.66 rows=1333333333 width=4)\n   Storage Filter: (k1 > 0)\n   Estimated Seeks: 1302084\n   Estimated Nexts: 2147483647\n   Estimated Docdb Result Width: 1\n(5 rows)\n---\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-15157]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-15157?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"gauravk-in","id":564644,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDY0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/564644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in","html_url":"https://github.com/gauravk-in","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gauravk-in/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25862/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25862/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}